      "detachmentPointsCost": 1,
      "category": null,
      "effects": [
        "Select 1 of the following Aspect Warriors units to gain the Battleline keyword:",
        "Dire Avengers",
        "Dark Reapers",
        "Fire Dragons",
        "Howling Banshees",
        "Striking Scorpions",
        "Swooping Hawks",
        "Warp Spiders",
        "Shining Spears",
        "Further, your army:",
        "Must include an Autarch or an Annatharch with a Path of the Aspect Shrine selection that allows it to Lead the Aspect Warriors unit you selected to gain the Battleline keyword.",
        "Can only include Aeldari units with the following keywords: Aspect Warriors or Transport [X]"
      ],
      "effectsHtml": "<p>Select 1 of the following <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"aspect-warriors\" data-type=\"keyword\">Aspect Warriors</span> units to gain the <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"battleline\" data-type=\"keyword\">Battleline</span> keyword:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dire Avengers</li>\n<li>Dark Reapers</li>\n<li>Fire Dragons</li>\n<li>Howling Banshees</li>\n<li>Striking Scorpions</li>\n<li>Swooping Hawks</li>\n<li>Warp Spiders</li>\n<li>Shining Spears</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Further, your army:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Must include an Autarch or an Annatharch with a Path of the Aspect Shrine selection that allows it to Lead the <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"aspect-warriors\" data-type=\"keyword\">Aspect Warriors</span> unit you selected to gain the <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"battleline\" data-type=\"keyword\">Battleline</span> keyword.</li>\n<li>Can only include Aeldari units with the following keywords: <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"aspect-warriors\" data-type=\"keyword\">Aspect Warriors</span> or <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"transport-x\" data-type=\"keyword\">Transport [X]</span></li>\n</ul>",
